nseee.top\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/f57ae4c5b07c4588681b6f97b0e72002.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"undefined\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><span><b>\\u00c0 ce jour, nous avons fourni des services haut de gamme \\u00e0 plus de 50\\u202f000 clients et obtenu des \\u00e9loges g\\u00e9n\\u00e9ralis\\u00e9s sur le march\\u00e9.<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"our_services_de\":\"<p><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/xing.slkekgnseee.top\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/f57ae4c5b07c4588681b6f97b0e72002.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"undefined\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><span><b>Bis heute haben wir mehr als 50.000 Kunden hochwertige Dienstleistungen bereitgestellt und erhalten breite Anerkennung auf dem Markt.<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"announcement_center_en\":\"<ol start=\\\"1\\\"><li><ol start=\\\"1\\\"><li><p><b>1\\uff0cThe order grabbing system operates 24\\/7. The platform automatically issues functions including order grabbing, withdrawals, and recharges.<\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b>2\\uff0cUsers must contact customer service to recharge and obtain a wallet address before placing orders. New users must add a shipping address before their first order.<\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b>3\\uff0cOrder amounts are automatically matched by the system. Matched order amounts fall within the account balance range. After receiving an order, proceed to the next replenishment cycle.<\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b>4\\uff0cAll basic-level members have a daily quota of 50 orders. Users must grab 50 orders to withdraw funds. Withdrawal timing is unrestricted, with actual arrival time taking approximately 1-10 minutes.<\\/b><\\/p><\\/li><\\/ol><\\/li><\\/ol><p><\\/p>\",\"announcement_center_zh\":\"<p><b>1\\uff0c\\u6436\\u55ae\\u7cfb\\u7d7124\\u5c0f\\u6642\\u904b\\u8f49\\u3002\\u5e73\\u53f0\\u81ea\\u52d5\\u4e0b\\u767c\\u6436\\u55ae\\u3001\\u63d0\\u73fe\\u3001\\u5132\\u503c\\u7b49\\u529f\\u80fd\\u3002<br><br><\\/b><\\/p><p><b>2\\uff0c\\u7528\\u6236\\u4e0b\\u55ae\\u